    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 34 Manor Street is a generous four bedroomed property situated in the central location of Manor Street, in Waterford City which is a sizable property, set out over three floors.\nAccommodation comprises entrance porch, spacoius living / dining room, kitchen / diner. First floor has two bedrooms and shower room. Second floor has two bedrooms.\nIn need of some modernization but has excellent potential to redevelop as a private residence or investment property given its prime location to the city centre.\nThe property has the benefit of gas fired central heating, uPVC double glazing windows throughout and a spacious south facing garden to the rear.\n\nLOCATION\nThe property is ideally located within easy walking distance of the Waterford City centre, SETU College Street Campus, Odeon Cinema, Tesco Poleberry and a host of local amenities on your door step.\n\nGARDEN\nSouth facing garden to rear in lawn with patio area.\n\nASKING PRICE 185,000\n\nFor further information and viewing arrangements please contact DNG Reid & Coppinger 051852233"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 0.90 x 1.36\nCarpet flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.65 x 7.99\nCarpet flooring. Open fireplace with gas fire. Curtains to window.\n\nKitchen / Diner - 3.40 x 2.70\nLinoleum flooring. Fitted kitchen. Door to rear patio and garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.97 x 3.98\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Blinds to window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 1.66 x 3.93\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nShower Room - 1.76 x 2.72\nTimber flooring. WC, WHB, electric T90 shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.48 x 3.93\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Curtains to windows.\n\nBedroom 4 - 1.68 x 3.83\nCarpet flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> South facing rear garden</li><li> Central location</li><li> uPVC Double Glazed Windows and Doors.</li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating.</ul>"
      },
